{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>And she shall draw off.</b> Like חלצו שד, and the meaning is she shall remove." "<b>Before him.</b> It is explicit in the words of the tradition that it is like לפניו, and the way of the peshat is before the one whose shoe is removed, like והיא כתובה פנים ואחור."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {1 "קבל׳ appears to abbreviate קבלה (tradition); the final letter resolved as alef by inference from the abbreviated form."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:24:44.559355791Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}